From 5f47ccf5888ea6d61b324523fb5354e226aad1c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amelia Crate <amelia.crate@chainguard.dev>
Date: Tue, 24 Jun 2025 08:46:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] crypto: reusable jitterentropy

make jitterentropy highly reusable

* move jent hash_time and read_random_block to a certified jitterentropy-optimized object
* shim all function calls from certified objects in a recompilable jitterentropy-shim object
* log build-time kernel version in jent init, so that it is identifiable at runtime
